; Lu 9:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-34","title":"John 4:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>My meat. 32; 6:33,38; Job 23:12; Ps 40:8; Isa 61:1-3; Lu 15:4-6,10; 19:10 Ac 20:35 and. 5:36; 17:4; 19:30; Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-35","title":"John 4:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>for. 30; Mt 9:37,38; Lu 10:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-36","title":"John 4:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>he that reapeth receiveth. Pr 11:30; Da 12:3; Ro 1:13; 6:22; 1Co 9:19-23; Php 2:15,16; 1Th 2:19 1Ti 4:16; 2Ti 4:7,8; Jas 5:19,20 both he that. 1Co 3:5-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-37","title":"John 4:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>One. Jud 6:3; Mic 6:15; Lu 19:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-38","title":"John 4:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>sent. Ac 2:41; 4:4,32; 5:14; 6:7; 8:4-8,14-17 other. 1:7; 2Ch 36:15; Jer 44:4; Mt 3:1-6; 4:23; 11:8-13; Ac 10:37,38,42,43 1Pe 1:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-39","title":"John 4:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>many. 10:41,42; 11:45 for. 29,42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-40","title":"John 4:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>they. Ge 32:26; Pr 4:13; So 3:4; Jer 14:8; Lu 8:38; 10:39; 24:29; Ac 16:15 he abode. Lu 19:5-10; 2Co 6:1,2; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-41","title":"John 4:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>many. Ge 49:10; Ac 1:8; 8:12,25; 15:3 because. 6:63; 7:46; Mt 7:28,29; Lu 4:32; 1Co 2:4,5; Heb 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-42","title":"John 4:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>for. 1:45-49; 17:8; Ac 17:11,12 and know. 29; 1:29; 3:14-18; 6:68,69; 11:17; Isa 45:22; 52:10; Lu 2:10,11,32 Ac 4:12; Ro 10:11-13; 2Co 5:19; 1Jo 4:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-43","title":"John 4:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>two. Mt 15:21-24; Mr 7:27,28; Ro 15:8 and. 46; 1:42; Mt 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-44","title":"John 4:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>that. Mt 13:57; Mr 6:4; Lu 4:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-45","title":"John 4:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>the Galilaeans. Mt 4:23,24; Lu 8:40 having. 2:13-16,23; 3:2 for. De 16:16; Lu 2:42-44; 9:53</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-46","title":"John 4:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>Cana.\"It is worthy of remark,\" says Dr. E. D. Clarke, who visited Cana a few years ago, \"that, walking among the ruins of a church, we saw large massy pots, answering the description given of the ancient vessels of the country; not preserved, but lying about, disregarded by the present inhabitants, as antiquities with whose original use they were unacquainted. From their appearance, and the number of them, it was quite evident that a practice of keeping water in large pots, each holding from eighteen to twenty-seven gallons, was once common in the country.\" (Compare the account of the water pots. ch. 2:6.)</p>\n<p>2:1-11; 21:2; Jos 19:28 nobleman. or, courtier, or, ruler. whose. Ps 50:15; 78:34; Ho 5:15; Mt 9:18; 15:22; 17:14,15; Lu 7:2; 8:42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-47","title":"John 4:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>he heard. Mr 2:1-3; 6:55,56; 10:47 that he. 11:21,32; Ps 46:1; Lu 7:6-8; 8:41; Ac 9:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-48","title":"John 4:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>Except. 41,42; 2:18; 12:37; 15:24; 20:29; Nu 14:11; Mt 16:1; 27:42; Lu 10:18 Lu 16:31; Ac 2:22; 1Co 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-49","title":"John 4:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>come. Ps 40:17; 88:10-12; Mr 5:23,35,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-50","title":"John 4:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>Go. 11:40; 1Ki 17:13-15; Mt 8:13; Mr 7:29,30; 9:23,24; Lu 17:14 Ac 14:9,10; Ro 4:20,21; Heb 11:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-51","title":"John 4:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>Thy. 50,53; 1Ki 17:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-53","title":"John 4:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>at the. Ps 33:9; 107:20; Mt 8:8,9,13 and himself. Lu 19:9; Ac 2:39; 16:15,34; 18:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-4-54","title":"John 4:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>2:1-11</p>"}]}